            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Teresa of Avila</strong><br>\nTeresa of Avila was born in 1515 in Gotarrendura, in the kingdom of Castile, Spain. From a young age, she showed a keen interest in the lives of the saints and the martyrs, as read in her mother's books. After her mother died, Teresa was only fourteen and sought the Virgin Mary as a spiritual mother. By the age of twenty, she decided to join the Carmelite Order, where she dedicated herself to a life of prayer and contemplation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Carmelite Convent</strong><br>\nAt the Carmelite Convent, Teresa found the practices to be less strict than she desired. She noticed that the convent's easygoing lifestyle did not fulfill her spiritual needs. As a result, Teresa experienced a profound period of illness and spiritual crisis, which later became the catalyst for her deeper religious experiences. During her recovery, she started to experience visions and spiritual enlightenment that greatly influenced her life.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Teresa's Spiritual Journey</strong><br>\nTeresa's spiritual journey was marked by periods of profound religious experiences and long episodes of illness. In her thirties, she reported her first mystical experience. These experiences were often followed by bouts of skepticism and ridicule from others. Yet, she considered them to be divine revelations that shaped her spiritual writings and teachings, which later earned her the recognition as a mystic.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
